% ============================================================================
% muscle-striation.query — worked recall queries against
% muscle-striation.adj (adj-facts-stdlib, BIOLOGY).
% ============================================================================
% Three queries: forward recall with citation, backward recall (bind `no`,
% find the one non-striated type), and a full-domain sweep demonstrating no
% abstention across all three muscle-tissue types.
% ============================================================================

import "muscle-striation.adj"

% Forward: is cardiac muscle striated?
? muscle_striated(cardiac, $Striated)

% Backward: which muscle type is NOT striated?
? muscle_striated($Muscle, no)

% Full-domain sweep: every muscle-tissue type this stdlib ships has a
% striation fact on record -- no abstention.
? muscle_striated(skeletal, $S1)
? muscle_striated(smooth, $S2)
